   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> Software </h1>",
      "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Smart Cabinets</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c3693",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "»quickPick« storage module",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »quickPick« storage module is the simple storage interface for handling individual components, complete tools, devices, orders and accessories. You can carry out warehouse bookings with just a few clicks.</p> <p>The integrated 3D kit realistically reproduces your warehouse in the software, giving you a quick overview of the storage locations of the items you are looking for. The circulation display allows you to monitor the use of your tools.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/5/csm_software_quickPick_en_dc4f68a89e.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 542
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3690",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Article statistics",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The ZOLLER article statistics allow you to conveniently analyze your tool consumption on the basis of stock bookings or goods receipts. With the help of \"hit/flop lists\", you can identify your \"top goods\" that have a high potential for optimization and, on the other hand, avoid \"flop goods\" that are lying as dead capital in your warehouses.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/f/csm_software_artikelstatistik_en_2144c04cfa.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 542
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3688",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Test equipment management",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Modern companies that are certified according to ISO 9001 and other quality standards are obliged to have a management system for the calibration of their test equipment and calibrators. ZOLLER's test equipment management system offers a convenient system that can be used to manage and monitor any test equipment and calibrators. The user can integrate inspection plans and incorporate documents. In addition to monitoring the calibration intervals, depending on time or use, any inspection plans can be designed and assigned for each piece of test equipment.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/e/csm_software_pruefmittel_en_18b0641458.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 542
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3686",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Device management",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Do you want to organize your equipment management at all times and keep an eye on its status? Do you want to record and manage all data quickly, conveniently and transparently? Then you are ideally equipped with ZOLLER fixture management. The monitoring interval that can be defined for each fixture also helps you to keep your fixtures up to date.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/6/csm_software_vorrichtung_en_5dda553b0f.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 542
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3684",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c3692",
