   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Storage solution »e.g. Storage« with »toolOrganizer« </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The storage solution »z.Storage« can control a »toolOrganizer« like a dispensing machine. In combination with the »smartCompartment«, the user is intuitively guided to the correct location via LEDs. Incorrect removal can therefore be ruled out. As »z.Storage« is browser-based software, it can be used on any end device with a browser.</p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [
    {
     "kind": "iframe",
     "src": "https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/_unJmvW9x2c?autohide=1&controls=1&enablejsapi=1&origin=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.zoller.info",
     "title": "The storage solution »z.Storage«"
    }
   ],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c4203",
   "bg": "lightgray",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Clever solutions for your networked production </h2>",
   "body": "<p>All storage locations are clearly and transparently displayed in the TMS Tool Management Solutions software. This makes the controlled removal and booking of tools easier than ever before.</p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [
    {
     "kind": "iframe",
     "src": "https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/iaV2Il_Gqn8?autohide=1&controls=1&enablejsapi=1&origin=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.zoller.info",
     "title": "ZOLLER Tooling Solutions – the perfect interface for your digital manufacturing"
    }
   ],
   "pos": "right",
